// Ch10 B01 "Pell stops at the edge" (C, 1.5 min). docs/kb/story/beats/act2_ch10.md §2 B01.
// O01: the first frame of Act II, overcast and flat after Ch9's gold dawn (color script `ch10`). The party
// comes down the bank in its Ch9 line: Toma, Pell, Asha, Ysolde, Liss, Rhen, Kerrid last.
// O02: at the water's edge PELL STOPS. The camera keeps tracking with the line onto the root-walk and does
// NOT stop with him: he grows small and tall and still behind them until Rhen turns. The act's first
// lesson in standing back (act1_ch09 §10). From here on Pell never steps off a lashed root into the water.
title: ch10_fen_edge
location: ch10/ossa_fen
---
@letterbox on
@music silence
@camera O01
@mark toma fen_line_1 walk
@mark pell pell_edge walk
@mark asha fen_line_3 walk
@mark ysolde fen_line_4 walk
@mark liss fen_line_5 walk
@mark rhen fen_line_6 walk
@mark kerrid fen_line_7 walk
@wait 3.0
@music ossa_fen fade=3.0
// M4-CIN-1304 (cinematics): O02 tracks Toma, the line's leader (track=), so the camera goes on with the line while
// Pell stops, as one continuous move; it ends when Toma reaches his mark.
@camera O02 blend=6.0 ease=in_out_sine track=toma
@mark toma root_walk_1 walk
@mark asha root_walk_2 walk
@mark ysolde root_walk_3 walk
@mark liss root_walk_4 walk
@mark kerrid root_walk_6 walk
@wait 5.0
@mark rhen root_walk_5 walk
@wait 1.5
@anim rhen look_at pell
Rhen [neutral]: You coming? #line:ch10_edge_001
@wait 2.0
Pell [neutral]: The water is theirs. I walk on the roots. Not in. #line:ch10_edge_002 #tn:"'Theirs': the Kirru clutch's. Pell is an exile and may not enter their water."
@wait 1.0
@mark pell root_walk_1b walk
@wait 2.0
@letterbox off
@camera release
===
